{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>zevachim ve'olot</b> — Two times in the Masorah. And it occurs: \"and they came to offer zevachim and olot\" (2 Kings 10:19) regarding Jehu, when he killed the prophets of the Baal. Just as there he executed judgment upon them and upon their gods — he demolished the altar of the Baal and killed them — so too here he executed judgment upon them and upon their gods."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:25.973434116Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}